This project is covered by two licences, because the firmware builds on
third-party code that carries a share-alike obligation.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
firmware/  -  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The USB HID stack in firmware/src (usb_*.c, usb_*.h, delay.*, gpio.h, system.h)
comes from Stefan Wagner's CH552-Macropad-mini and CH552-USB-Knob projects,
https://github.com/wagiminator, which are licensed CC BY-SA 3.0. Some of those
files have been modified here, and the rest of the firmware is compiled together
with them, so the firmware as a whole is distributed under the same licence.

    This work is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
    Unported License. To view a copy of this license, visit
    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/ or send a letter to Creative
    Commons, PO Box 1866, Mountain View, CA 94042, USA.

firmware/src/ch554.h is a hardware definition header from WCH,
Copyright (C) W.ch 1999-2014.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/, docs/  -  MIT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The host-side tools share no code with the firmware and derive from none of the
above; they only speak to the device over USB. They are offered under MIT.

